  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": null,
    "grammar": "\"behave\" takes an adverb (*behave well*), and in the *be good* sense it can take a reflexive pronoun (*behave yourself*). Some languages always use a reflexive form here; English does not need one: *Please behave*.",
